      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we use Substack instead of LinkedIn Newsletter?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">For MD/CEO of manufacturing SME, Plant Head, VP Sales, Export Manager, second-generation family-business scion where audience is primarily on LinkedIn (senior banking, real estate, B2B manufacturing, professional services), LinkedIn Newsletter beats Substack: (1) Zero-friction subscribe (1-click for LinkedIn users) vs Substack requiring email signup. (2) LinkedIn algorithm promotes newsletter content to non-subscribers (Substack has no discovery). (3) Native comments + engagement + shareability. For non-LinkedIn audiences (creator/consumer/lifestyle), Substack has advantages. For professional B2B Manufacturing Leaders, LinkedIn Newsletter is optimal.</div>
